  "reality_frame/en_us/entries/black_hole/black_hole.json#pages/0/text": "With modifications made to the Data Chip you should be able to warp a Black Hole into the backrooms. $(br2)When the black hole is right-clicked with a singularity, it will consume it and drop 3 pieces of antimatter in return.",
